    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2777" root="بطش" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَطْشٌ</span></b>  inf. n. of 1 [q. v.]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>Might,</i> or
<i>strength, in war</i> or <i>fight:</i> or <i>courage; valour,</i> or
<i>valiantness; prowess:</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَأْسٌ</span>. (K.) You say,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ شَدِيدُ البَطْشِ</span> [<i>A man of great might,</i> &amp;c.].
(K, * TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>Anger.</i> (Har p. 258.)

